hadiths[32]{hadithnumber,text}:
"492","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Ham aakhri aur Qiyaamat key din sabqat ley jaaney waley hain. Magar ye ke unhey ham se pehley Kitaab di gai. Phir ye unka din hai jo un par farz kya gaya tha. To unhon-ne us mein ikhtelaaf kya aur Allah ne hamein hidaayat di. To log us mein hamaarey taabe hain: Yahood kal aur Nasaara parson. (Bukhari: 876)"
"493","[AI-translation] Abu Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) par gawahi deta hun, Aap ne farmaya: Jumuah key din ghusl har baaligh par waajib hai, aur miswaak karey aur khushbu lagaaey agar paaey. (Bukhari: 880)"
"494","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo Jumuah key din janaabat key ghusl jaisa ghusl karey phir (pehli ghadi mein) jaey to goya us ne oont qurbaan kya. Aur jo doosri ghadi mein jaey to goya us ne gaey qurbaan ki. Aur jo teesri ghadi mein jaey to goya us ne seengon wala mendha qurbaan kya. Aur jo chauthi ghadi mein jaey to goya us ne murghi qurbaan ki. Aur jo paanchwein ghadi mein jaey to goya us ne anda qurbaan kya. Phir jab Imam nikley to farishtey haazir hotey hain aur zikr suntey hain."
"495","[AI-translation] Salmaan Faarsi (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jo aadmi Jumuah key din ghusl karey aur jitni paaki ki taaqat rakkhey paaki haasil karey aur apne tel mein se tel lagaaey ya apne ghar ki khushbu mein se lagaaey. Phir nikley aur do (aadmiyon) key darmiyaan judai na karey. Phir jo uskey liye likha gaya padhey. Phir khaamosh rahey jab Imam baat karey. Magar use maaf kar diya jaaeyga jo uskey aur doosrey Jumuah key darmiyaan hai. (Bukhari: 883)"
"496","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke un se kaha gaya: Unhon-ne zikr kya ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jumuah key din ghusl karo aur apne sar dho agarchey tum junbi na ho aur khushbu lagao. To unhon-ne kaha: Ghusl ka to haan. Aur khushbu ka to main nahi jaanta. (Bukhari: 884)"
"497","[AI-translation] Umar (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne masjid key darwaazey key paas resham ka joda dekha. To unhon-ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Kaash Aap ye khareed lein aur use Jumuah key din aur wafd key liye pehnein jab wo Aap key paas aaein. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak ye wahi pehenta hai jiska Aakhirat mein koi hissa nahi hai. Phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas un mein se jodey aey. To Aap ne Umar bin Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) ko un mein se joda diya. To Umar ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Aap ne mujhey pehnaaya jabke Aap ne Utaarid key jodey key baarey mein jo kaha tha kaha tha? Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak main ne tumhey pehnaaya nahi ke tum use pehno. To Umar bin Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) ne use Makkah mein apne mushrik bhai ko pehnaaya. (Bukhari: 886)"
"498","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Agar main apni ummat par ya logon par mushakkat na samajhta to unhey har namaz key sath miswaak ka hukm deta. (Bukhari: 887)"
"499","[AI-translation] Anas (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Main ne tum par miswaak mein bahut kaha hai. (Bukhari: 888)"
"500","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Jumuah mein Fajr ki namaz mein (Alif Laam Meem Tanzeel) Sajda aur (Hal Ataa alal Insaan) padhtey they. (Bukhari: 891)"
"501","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Tum sab nigraan ho aur tum sab apni raiyyat key baarey mein poochhey jaaogey. Imam nigraan hai aur apni raiyyat key baarey mein poochha jaaeyga. Aur aadmi apne ghar walon mein nigraan hai aur wo apni raiyyat key baarey mein poochha jaaeyga. Aur aurat apne shohar key ghar mein nigraan hai aur wo apni raiyyat key baarey mein poochhi jaaeygi. Aur khaadim apne aaqa key maal mein nigraan hai aur wo apni raiyyat key baarey mein poochha jaaeyga. Unhon-ne kaha: Aur mera khayaal hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Aur aadmi apne baap key maal mein nigraan hai aur wo apni raiyyat key baarey mein poochha jaaeyga. Aur tum sab nigraan ho aur apni raiyyat key baarey mein poochhey jaaogey. (Bukhari: 893)"
"502","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) ki (Ham aakhri aur sabqat ley jaaney waley hain) wali hadees qareeb guzar chuki hai. Aur yahaan uskey aakhir mein izaafa kya: Phir farmaya: Har Musalman par haq hai ke wo har saat dinon mein aik din ghusl karey jis mein wo apna sar aur apna jism dhoey. (Bukhari: 897)"
"503","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai jo Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki biwi hain, unhon-ne kaha: Log Jumuah key din apne gharon aur Awaali se baari baari aatey they. To gubaar mein aatey. Unhey gubaar aur paseena lagta aur un se paseena nikalta. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas un mein se aik insaan aaya jabke Aap merey paas they. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kaash tum apne is din key liye paaki haasil kartey. (Bukhari: 902)"
"504","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Log apne aap key kaam karney waley they. Aur wo jab Jumuah ki taraf jaatey to apni haalat mein jaatey. To un se kaha gaya: Kaash tum ghusl kartey. (Bukhari: 903)"
"505","[AI-translation] Anas bin Maalik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Jumuah padhtey they jab sooraj dhal jaata. (Bukhari: 905)"
"506","[AI-translation] Anas bin Maalik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab sardi sakht hoti to namaz jaldi padhtey aur jab garmi sakht hoti to namaz thandi kar key padhtey, yaani Jumuah."
"507","[AI-translation] Abu Abs (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne Jumuah ki taraf jaatey huey kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Jiskey donon qadam Allah key raastey mein gubaar aalood huey to Allah use aag par haraam kar dega. (Bukhari: 907)"
"508","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mana kya ke aadmi apne bhai ko uski jagah se uthaaey aur us mein baithay. Kaha gaya: Jumuah? Unhon-ne kaha: Jumuah aur uskey siwa. (Bukhari: 911)"
"509","[AI-translation] Saaeb bin Yazeed (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Jumuah key din pukaar ki ibteda jab Imam mimbar par baithey Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) aur Abu Bakr aur Umar (Raziallahu anhum) key zamaaney mein thi. Phir jab Usmaan (Raziallahu anhu) ka zamaana tha aur log bahut ho gaey to unhon-ne Zaura par teesri pukaar badhaai. (Bukhari: 912)"
"510","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Saaeb Raziallahu anhu se) aik riwayat mein hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka aik key siwa koi moazzin na tha. Aur Jumuah key din pukaar jab Imam baithta, yaani mimbar par. (Bukhari: 913)"
"511","[AI-translation] Muawiya bin Abi Sufyan (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke wo Jumuah key din mimbar par baithey. Phir jab moazzin ne azaan kahi to us ne kaha: Allahu Akbar Allahu Akbar! To Muawiya ne kaha: Allahu Akbar Allahu Akbar! Us ne kaha: Main gawahi deta hun ke Allah key siwa koi mabood nahi. To Muawiya (Raziallahu anhu) ne kaha: Aur main. Us ne kaha: Main gawahi deta hun ke Muhammad Allah key Rasool hain. To Muawiya ne kaha: Aur main. Phir jab us ne azaan poori ki to farmaya: Ae logon! Beshak main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko is majlis par suna tha jab moazzin ne azaan kahi, Aap wo kehtey they jo tum ne mujh se meri baat suni hai. (Bukhari: 914)"
"512","[AI-translation] Sahl bin Saad Saaedi (Raziallahu anhu) ki mimbar key hukm mein hadees guzar chuki hai aur peechey hattey huey namaz padhney ka zikr. Aur is mein izaafa kya: Phir jab faarigh huey to logon ki taraf mutawajjeh huey aur farmaya: Ae logon! Beshak main ne ye isliye kya taake tum meri pairwi karo aur meri namaz seekho. (Bukhari: 917)"
"513","[AI-translation] Jaabir bin Abdullah (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Khajoor ka tana tha jis se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) tek lagaaey khadey hotey they. Phir jab Aap key liye mimbar rakkha gaya to ham ne taney se das mahiney ki gaabhan oontniyon jaisi aawaazein sunein. Yahan tak ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) utrey aur Aap ne apna haath us par rakkha. (Bukhari: 918). Saalim se unkey waalid se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko mimbar par khutba detey huey suna. To Aap ne farmaya: Jo Jumuah mein aaey to use ghusl karna chaahiye. (919). Ye hadees Ziya-ud-Daaghistani key zawaed mein se hai aur Zabidi key asl mein se nahi hai."
"514","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) khadey ho kar khutba detey, phir baithey, phir khadey hotey, jaisey tum ab kartey ho. (Bukhari: 920)"
"515","[AI-translation] Amr bin Taghlib (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas maal ya qaidi laaey gaey aur Aap ne taqseem kya. To Aap ne aadmiyon ko diya aur aadmiyon ko chhor diya. To Aap ko khabar pahunchi ke jineh Aap ne chhoda unhon-ne naaraazgi ki. To Aap ne Allah ki hamd ki phir us par sana ki, phir farmaya: Amma baad! To Allah ki qasam! Beshak main aadmi ko deta hun aur aadmi ko chhorey rakhta hun. Aur jo main chhorey rakhta hun wo mujhey us se zyada mehboob hai jisey main deta hun. Lekin main qaumon ko deta hun jo unkey dilon mein bechaini aur ghabrahat dekhta hun. Aur qaumon ko uskey supurd karta hun jo Allah ne unkey dilon mein beniyaazi aur bhalai rakhi hai. Un mein Amr bin Taghlib hain. To Allah ki qasam! Mujhey pasand nahi ke merey liye Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key kalimat key badley surkh oont hon. (Bukhari: 923)"
"516","[AI-translation] Abu Humaid Saaedi (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) shaam ko namaz key baad khadey huey aur tashahhud padha aur Allah ki uskey shayaan-e-shaan sana ki, phir farmaya: Amma baad! (Bukhari: 925)"
"517","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) mimbar par chadhey. Aur wo aakhri majlis thi jis mein Aap baithey, jabke Aap ne apne kandhon par chaadar lapet rakhi thi aur apna sar maili patti se baandh rakkha tha. To Aap ne Allah ki hamd ki aur us par sana ki, phir farmaya: Ae logon! Meri taraf (aao). To wo Aap ki taraf aey. Phir farmaya: Amma baad! Beshak Ansaar ka ye qabeela kam hongey aur log zyada hongey. To jo Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki ummat mein se kisi cheez ka muqarrar ho aur taaqat rakkhey ke us mein kisi ko nuqsaan ya faeda pahunchaaey to use unkey nekokaar se qabool karna chaahiye aur unkey badkaar se darguzar karna chaahiye. (Bukhari: 927)"
"518","[AI-translation] Jaabir bin Abdullah (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Aik aadmi aaya jabke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Jumuah key din logon ko khutba dey rahey they. To Aap ne farmaya: Ae fulaan! Kya tum ne namaz padhi? Us ne kaha: Nahi. Aap ne farmaya: Utho aur do rakatein padho. (Bukhari: 930)"
"519","[AI-translation] Anas bin Maalik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key zamaaney mein logon ko qehat pada. To jabke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Jumuah key din khutba dey rahey they ke aik dehaati khada hua aur us ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Maal halaak ho gaya aur ghar waley bhookey rahey. To Allah se hamaarey liye dua kijiye. To Aap ne apney haath uthaaey. Aur ham aasmaan mein baadal ka tukda na dekhtey they. To qasam us zaat ki jiskey haath mein meri jaan hai! Aap ne unhey na rakkha yahan tak ke pahaadon jaisey baadal uthay. Phir Aap apne mimbar se na utrey yahan tak ke main ne baarish ko Aapki daadhi par behtey huey dekha. To ham par us din aur agley din aur us se agley din aur uskey baad waley din baarish hui yahan tak ke doosrey Jumuah tak. Aur wo dehaati khada hua ya uskey siwa ne kaha. To us ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Imaaratein gir gaein aur maal doob gaya. To Allah se hamaarey liye dua kijiye. To Aap ne apney haath uthaaey aur farmaya: Ae Allah! Hamaarey gird aur ham par nahi. To Aap apne haath se baadal key kisi koney ki taraf ishaara na kartey magar wo phat jaata. Aur Madina talaab jaisa ho gaya aur Qanaat naala mahina bhar behta raha. Aur kisi taraf se koi na aaya magar khoob baarish ki khabar deta. (Bukhari: 933)"
"520","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum Jumuah key din apne saathi se kaho: Khaamosh raho, jabke Imam khutba dey raha ho, to tum ne laghw kya. (Bukhari: 934)"
"521","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Jumuah key din ka zikr kya aur farmaya: Us mein ghadi hai jisey koi Musalman banda na paaeyga jabke wo khada namaz padh raha ho aur Allah Taala se koi cheez maangey magar wo use dega. Aur Aap ne apne haath se ishaara kya ke wo thodi hai. (Bukhari: 935)"
"522","[AI-translation] Jaabir bin Abdullah (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Jabke ham Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath namaz padh rahey they ke khaana laadaney wala qaafila aaya. To wo uski taraf mutawajjeh huey yahan tak ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath baarah aadmiyon key siwa koi baaqi na raha. To ye aayat naazil hui: (Aur jab unhon-ne tijaarat ya khel dekha to uski taraf phail gaey aur tumhey khada chhor diya). (Bukhari: 936)"
"523","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Zohar se pehley do rakatein aur uskey baad do rakatein aur Maghrib key baad apne ghar mein do rakatein aur Isha key baad do rakatein padhtey they. Aur Aap Jumuah key baad namaz na padhtey they yahan tak ke wapas jaatey aur do rakatein padhtey. (Bukhari: 937). Kitaab-u-Salaat-il-Khauf."
